{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは！石塚瑶季です🐱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一昨日まで、巨人は"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "阪神との首位攻防戦でした⚾️"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/moboDjBWb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちろん行かない選択肢などなく、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "現地へ行ってきました！！🔥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さあ、どの試合だと思いますか~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドラマティックな展開のアツい１戦目"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "攻撃が中々繋がらなかった２戦目"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もはや何も言葉が出ない３戦目"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "正解は２戦目でした、、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いや、チャンスはあったのよ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ただね、才木投手が強すぎる。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "流石に強すぎるよね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ただのファン目線としては、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大城選手を出しても良かったのでは！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんて思ったりもしましたが！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "キャベッジ選手のホームランを"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みることができたので良かったです( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mob2EqeQj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日の横浜戦は負けてしまったけど"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乱打戦は観ていて面白いから"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "現地でみたかった！！って思いました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これ私あるあるなんですけど、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分の観に行く試合の前後"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝ち負け置いといて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "めっちゃ良い試合するんですよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今このブログ書いてる段階では"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "DeNAvs巨人は3-2でございます☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まあシーズンが始まる時には"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7月にこの位置いるなんて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "想像してなかったもんなああ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "野球面白すぎるよ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この気持ちを誰かと共有したい、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "語りたい、、と思っている時に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "マネージャーさんからとてつもなく"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しいお仕事をお聞きしまして。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんと、来週16日の"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ニッポン放送「ナイツ ザ・ラジオショー」さん"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "13時台に生出演させていただきます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に飛び跳ねて喜びました\\(◦´-`◦)/"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しい、嬉しすぎる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "塙さんと野球トーク出来るかな"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "土屋さんと学生トーク出来るかな"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "箕輪さんにツッコんでいただけるかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドキドキですが、すっごく楽しみです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんもぜひお聴きください📻"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#ナイツザラジオショー"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobg6jurh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、先週の日曜日は"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "3回目のミート&グリートでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "七夕に近いって事で浴衣を着てみました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブや映画お疲れ様、だとか"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何気ない会話も、1秒1秒が全部大切で"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも力をもらってます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなの力ってとてつもないです"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に幸せな時間をいつもありがとう！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次は19日だね"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと1週間ちょっと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また会えるの楽しみ~\\🩷/"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobMafL9U.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobV6w1cW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浴衣といえば、ユニゾンエアーさんでも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛い浴衣を着させていただいております"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【ゆにえあ祭'26記念トーク動画☀️】にも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "茉莉さんと登場させていただいております！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://x.com/kh_unisonair/status/2074780551689691386?s=46&t=s1xrDT56j1FrOQGBQvfmYw"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏祭り行きたいな~"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobHcNL0B.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobFKdtbX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浴衣たまにゃんぜひゲットしてください🐱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして先ほど更新された"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日向坂ちゃんねるに"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「毎日なか卯生活」が投稿されております！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひぜひこの週末に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "観てくださったら嬉しいです🐰"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mob6JEmU5.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/iExg3FDu5po"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また詳しくはブログ書きます！笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "瑶季"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Instagram @ishizukatamaki_official"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#286"}], "source": "official"}